SUMMARY:FREE TOGETHER public event in Montclair on October 24
DESCRIPTION:Four local community organizations invite you to our public connection event on October 24\, 10am–2pm\, outdoors on Church Street in Montclair Center. \nWe’re asking how we can all be FREE TOGETHER? – supporting one another in freedom\, giving freely and joyfully to one another in our community\, and expressing our needs freely and comfortably? \nLet’s open our imaginations – for a future where we have the freedom that comes from meeting one another’s needs within our community. \nStop by for an interactive brainstorming and live art experience. Come meet local organizations already building community support systems! Learn about mutuality and mutual aid opportunities in our local area. We’ll listen to your ideas about community giving and receiving. \nFun activities for adults and children will be offered. Free snacks too! \n• What could you imagine doing for or giving to your community – things that you enjoy so much that you wouldn’t want money to do them? \n• What do you have difficulty asking for help with? Help that you wish for\, things you’ve been putting off\, things big or small\, for you or your family? \nFREE TOGETHER qr codeVolunteer artists will help us illustrate and express your ideas and imagination\, for a collective visual collage of community members’ hopes\, needs\, desires\, offers\, and contributions – a vision of how we can be FREE TOGETHER. \nWe don’t have all the answers. We’re inviting you to come brainstorm with us.\nFREE TOGETHER public event in Montclair\, NJ\non mutuality and mutual aid\nSaturday\, October 24\, 2026\, 10am–2pm\n(Rain date Sun Oct 25)\noutdoors on Church St\, pedestrian plaza closed to car traffic\nhttps://linktr.ee/free_together \n• BEAM – Building Essex Area Mutuality\, https://beamnj.org/\n• TheVillageMate\, https://thevillagemate.zite.so/\n• Montclair Area Solidarity Network\, https://montclairsolidarity.org/\n• Kindom Collective\, https://kindomcollective.com/ \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/free-together-public-event-in-montclair-on-october-24/
LOCATION:Church Street\, Church Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture,Community,General Events,Kids & Families
