SUMMARY:Harvest Fest
DESCRIPTION:Hoping your fall season is off to a great start! I’m pleased to invite you and yours to our annual KW NJ Metro Harvest Fest – the one with something for everyone — live band\, pony rides\, taste treats from local eateries\, face painting\, petting zoo\, pet adoption\, pumpkin picking and decorating\, holiday photo ops and … THE FAMOUS ICE CREAM TRUCK! \n \nCome\, shmooze\, relish in community\, maybe even make a new friend – and definitely join us in the celebrating the change of seasons! Looking forward to seeing you there! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
