SUMMARY:Trunk or Treat at Central
DESCRIPTION:🎃🍁 Join Us for Trunk or Treat! 🍬🚗 \nCome for the candy\, stay for the community! \nCentral Presbyterian Church invites families\, friends\, and neighbors to a fun-filled afternoon of Halloween festivities! \nBring your little ghosts\, goblins\, and superheroes for an afternoon of decorated car trunks\, sweet treats\, festive snacks\, photo opportunities\, and plenty of fall fun! \n📅 Saturday\, October 24\, 2026\n🕛 12:00 PM – 2:00 PM\n📍 Central Presbyterian Church\n46 Park Street\, Montclair\, NJ \n🍬 Candy & Treats\n🎃 Festively Decorated Trunks\n🧁 Snacks & Refreshments\n📸 Fun Photo Opportunities \nThis is a FREE community event\, and everyone is welcome! \nPut on your favorite costume\, bring the whole family\, and join us as we celebrate the season with friendship\, laughter\, and community spirit. \nWe can’t wait to see you there \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
