SUMMARY:Gather and Ground - A Yoga Mini Retreat for Menopause
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, October 24th 2-5pm for Gather and Ground – A Yoga Mini Retreat for Menopause. All levels of yoga experience are welcome. Designed for women navigating perimenopause\, menopause and beyond\, this workshop offers: \n⁠Strength & Balance Flow – an active practice focused on maintaining strength\, stability and balance as our bodies change\nGentle Flow & Mobility – slower movement designed to support mobility\, release tension and help you feel more comfortable in your body\nRestorative Yoga & Deep Rest – a deeply supportive practice to downshift the nervous system and encourage rest and recovery. \nMenopause is not one experience\, and there is no single “right” way to move through it. Come learn\, move\, rest\, ask questions and explore what supports your body now. You’ll leave with lovingly prepared\, homemade snacks\, handouts summarizing the key points of our time together\, and a supportive community. \nThe first 10 sign-ups get 10% off: Select “Early Bird” under ticket options \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
