SUMMARY:Amara's Caribbean BBQ at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Amara’s Caribbean BBQ is a family-owned food business bringing bold\, flavorful authentic Jamaican dishes to New Jersey and beyond. Known for crowd favorites like oxtails\, charcoal-grilled jerk chicken\, and Rasta pasta\, they’re passionate about serving delicious food that brings people together. From pop-ups to private events and catering\, Amara’s Caribbean BBQ delivers big flavor\, warm hospitality\, and a true taste of the Caribbean. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
