SUMMARY:Clementine's Basement live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Clementine’s Basement entered the rock scene of North Jersey in May of 2024. This is no ordinary cover band. The diverse backgrounds of the band members bring a powerhouse of musical energy blending classic hits with some fresh surprises. Clementine’s Basement will make your heart race\, your feet stomp and your soul soar. The band is a hit at parties\, on the bar scene\, at dance halls and everywhere you find uplifting music. Most importantly\, this band just has a good time playing and the joy is infectious. Check out their website www.clementinesbasement.com or contact them at info@clementinesbasement.com. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
