SUMMARY:Spooky Spiotta
DESCRIPTION:Halloween is almost here and Spooky Spiotta is back! Join the fun on Sunday\, October 25 from 11AM–1PM at Spiotta Park (20–32 Village Plaza\, South Orange\, NJ). All are invited to come dressed in their Halloween best and enjoy a morning of free festivities\, including a costume contest with prizes from local businesses\, a Halloween obstacle course\, trick-or-treat stations\, games\, activities and more. All activities are free and open to the community. Special thanks to sponsor Natalie Farrell of Weichert Realtors. Learn more at southorangedowntown.org. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
