SUMMARY:American Ethos Concert
DESCRIPTION:As part of the Glen Ridge Community Concerts series\, join us Sunday\, Oct 25\, at 3 pm\, for a multi-media recital\, “American Ethos” performed by pianist Carolyn Enger. The program reminds us of the unique spirit of America and the different cultures that make up our nation. Her repertoire shines a light on diverse\, often overlooked voices\, as well as more well-known composers of our time. Selections include works by Leonard Bernstein\, Aaron Copland\, Craig Urquhart\, Daron Hagen\, John Corigliano\, Margaret Bonds\, Florence Price\, Ned Rorem\, Meredith Monk\, Margaret Ruthven Lang\, Robert Sirota and William Grant Still. For more information and tickets\, go to https://www.glenridgeconcerts.org/ \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
